# Live Askell docs

OpenAPI in `spec/` is the endpoint contract. Flows (V2 checkout, 3DS, embedded `askell.js`, webhooks, v1 vs v2) live in prose docs that training data will get wrong.

When the task touches Askell domain (tools, resources, server instructions, eval questions, webhooks, checkout, billing), load the `askell-docs` skill and fetch live:

1. Index: https://docs.askell.is/llms.txt
2. Then the page URL from that index (prefer `/en/`).

Do not vendor the docs site into git. Do not invent endpoints from memory — check bundled spec + live page.
